{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28706","headline":"闻开江相国宋下世二首 二 · 杜牧","name":"闻开江相国宋下世二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"月落清湘棹不喧，玉杯瑶瑟奠苹蘩。\n谁令力制乘轩鹤，自取机沈在槛猿。\n位极乾坤三事贵，谤兴华夏一夫冤。\n宵衣旰食明天子，日伏青蒲不爲言。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28706.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28706","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}